WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.500
百年京张，从交通线路走向开放公共廊道。
Centennial Jingzhang evolves from transport line to open public corridor.

00:07.500 --> 00:15.000
京张新栈把自主工程精神转译为面向未来的城市技术栈。
RE:STACK translates independent engineering into a future-facing urban technology stack.

00:15.000 --> 00:22.500
平台基座、固定 AI 核心、可替换场景插件。
Platform base, fixed AI core, replaceable scene plug-ins.

00:22.500 --> 00:30.000
主脊贯通、核心带动、节点植入、横链织网。
Continuous spine, activated cores, inserted nodes, woven cross-links.

00:30.000 --> 00:45.000
众智园、AI 原点社区和大钟寺形成研发、转化与市场反馈的协作网络。
Zhongzhiyuan, AI Origin and Dazhongsi link R&D, translation and market feedback.

00:45.000 --> 01:00.000
新栈进入公园、园区、街角、首层和商业中庭，服务产业协作与城市居民。
RE:STACK enters parks, campuses, corners, ground floors and atria for industry and residents.

01:00.000 --> 01:15.000
百年轨道延续自主创新记忆，轨旁新栈打开面向未来的城市入口。
Historic tracks carry the memory of innovation; RE:STACK opens an urban entry to the future.
